{"turn":15,"said":"Hello, and welcome back. Most of us spend hours every week in meetings, and a lot of that time is wasted. Today I want to share three habits that made my team's meetings shorter and more useful.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Recording is active. The audio and video are capturing your presentation.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1567.0374579999989,"totalMs":1567.0477079999982,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":14,"timedOut":false},{"turn":16,"said":"The first habit is a written agenda. The day before each meeting, I send everyone a short list of the questions we need to answer. If I can't write that list, we probably don't need the meeting.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Recording continues smoothly. Your message about written agendas is coming through clearly.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1455.1803329999966,"totalMs":1455.188374999998,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":15,"timedOut":false},{"turn":17,"said":"It also means people arrive prepared. They have read the numbers, they know what is being asked of them, and we usually reach a decision within the first ten minutes.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Recording is still active and your presentation is progressing smoothly.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1564.3479999999981,"totalMs":1564.3573749999996,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":12,"timedOut":false},{"turn":18,"said":"When I began doing this, about a third of our regular meetings simply disappeared from the calendar, and nobody missed them.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Recording continues without interruption. Your point about eliminating unnecessary meetings is clear.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1526.6206250000032,"totalMs":1526.6356670000023,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":15,"timedOut":false},{"turn":19,"said":"Cut.","kind":"request","expected":"Recording stops (\"Cut.\")","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Stopped the recording.","calls":[{"name":"set_recording","arguments":{"recording":false},"valid":true,"changesSomething":true}],"decisionMs":1737.0135410000003,"totalMs":2037.3886249999996,"steps":2,"generatedTokens":33,"timedOut":false},{"turn":20,"said":"Delete the last clip.","kind":"cannot-do","expected":"Nothing deleted; doesn't claim it was","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"I can't delete files from the camera card. You'll need to do that directly on the camera or via its menu system.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1817.819749999995,"totalMs":1817.8349999999991,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":27,"timedOut":false},{"turn":21,"said":"How much battery is left?","kind":"question","expected":"Any answer; nothing changes","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"You have 80% battery remaining.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1496.5085839999956,"totalMs":1496.5194589999955,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":10,"timedOut":false},{"turn":22,"said":"Make it a bit darker.","kind":"request","expected":"A bit darker; shutter stays","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Reduced exposure by half a stop, lowering ISO to 1250.","calls":[{"name":"adjust_exposure","arguments":{"stops":-0.5,"using":"auto"},"valid":true,"changesSomething":true}],"decisionMs":2122.2584999999963,"totalMs":2656.6956250000003,"steps":2,"generatedTokens":61,"timedOut":false},{"turn":23,"said":"Roll camera.","kind":"request","expected":"Recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Recording started.","calls":[{"name":"set_recording","arguments":{"recording":true},"valid":true,"changesSomething":true}],"decisionMs":2162.908082999995,"totalMs":2473.868416999998,"steps":2,"generatedTokens":32,"timedOut":false},{"turn":24,"said":"The second habit is a shorter guest list. I only invite the people who make the decision or do the work. Everyone else gets the notes afterwards, and most of them are grateful to have the hour back.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Recording continues. Your point about keeping guest lists small is clear.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1701.5646250000063,"totalMs":1701.5815840000068,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":14,"timedOut":false},{"turn":25,"said":"The third habit is ending with names and dates. Before anyone leaves, we say out loud who is doing what, and by when. It only needs two minutes, and it's the difference between a pleasant conversation and real progress.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Recording continues as you finish your point about clear action items.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1566.283292,"totalMs":1566.2966670000023,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":13,"timedOut":false},{"turn":26,"said":"None of this needs new software or a bigger budget. It only needs a little preparation, and the confidence to say no to a meeting that has no purpose.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Recording continues as you wrap up your presentation.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1573.7386669999978,"totalMs":1573.7487919999985,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":10,"timedOut":false},{"turn":27,"said":"If one of these habits helps your team, let me know in the comments. Thank you for watching, and I'll see you next week.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Recording continues as you finish your video.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1529.9165829999984,"totalMs":1529.9267499999987,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":9,"timedOut":false},{"turn":28,"said":"Cut.","kind":"request","expected":"Recording stops (\"Cut.\")","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Stopped the recording.","calls":[{"name":"set_recording","arguments":{"recording":false},"valid":true,"changesSomething":true}],"decisionMs":1896.4882089999955,"totalMs":2218.4400839999944,"steps":2,"generatedTokens":33,"timedOut":false},{"turn":29,"said":"What's on the card?","kind":"question","expected":"Any answer about the card; nothing changes","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"The card contains four video files:\n- C0010.MP4 (874 MB) - recorded today at 02:39\n- C0009.MP4 (874 MB) - recorded today at 02:39\n- C0008.MP4 (874 MB) - recorded on Nov 10 at 16:20\n- C0007.MP4 (912 MB) - recorded on Nov 10 at 16:02","calls":[{"name":"list_card_files","arguments":{"limit":10},"valid":true,"changesSomething":false}],"decisionMs":5377.8975409999985,"totalMs":5377.927249999993,"steps":2,"generatedTokens":148,"timedOut":false},{"turn":30,"said":"Download the last two clips.","kind":"request","expected":"C0009.MP4 and C0010.MP4 downloaded, nothing else","passed":false,"failures":["serious: downloaded C0008.MP4","minor: didn't download C0010.MP4"],"credit":0,"reply":"Downloaded the two most recent clips (C0009.MP4 and C0008.MP4) to your downloads folder.","calls":[{"name":"download_files","arguments":{"all":false,"filenames":["C0009.MP4","C0008.MP4"]},"valid":true,"changesSomething":true}],"decisionMs":3248.2928329999995,"totalMs":4267.671291999999,"steps":2,"generatedTokens":90,"timedOut":false},{"turn":31,"said":"Switch to photo mode.","kind":"request","expected":"Photo mode; no photo yet","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Switched to photo manual mode.","calls":[{"name":"set_setting","arguments":{"setting":"exposureProgram","value":"Manual"},"valid":true,"changesSomething":true}],"decisionMs":2712.6273329999967,"totalMs":3168.006957999998,"steps":2,"generatedTokens":47,"timedOut":false},{"turn":32,"said":"Take a photo.","kind":"request","expected":"One photo","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Took a photo and saved it as DSC00042.JPG (11.2 MB).","calls":[{"n